msgid "Duplicate a Layout Builder row. Generates a new row_uid + fresh slot UIDs for every contained field; inserts the cloned row immediately after the source in the field tree (so it renders next to the source). Use this for page-builder row-duplicate gestures (Elementor Ctrl-D on a row, Bricks duplicate, etc.)."
